      "date": "2026-05-29T11:35:01.000Z",
      "title": "Price target increased by 7.8% to ₹3,653",
      "body": "Up from ₹3,389, the current price target is an average from 25 analysts. New target price is approximately in line with last closing price of ₹3,844. Stock is up 18% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹56.87 for next year compared to ₹42.05 last year.",
